@startuml
title UC-02 入场设计顺序图（AI-辅助）
actor 收费员
boundary AccessController as controller
control AccessService as access
entity AccessRepository as repo
participant PassClient as pass
participant SpaceClient as space

收费员 -> controller : ① POST /api/v1/access/entries
activate controller
controller -> access : enter(request, key)
activate access
access -> repo : ② registerRequest(key, payload)
activate repo
repo --> access : 校验同键内容
deactivate repo
access -> repo : withRequestLock(key, 入场流程)
activate repo
note right of repo : 请求键行锁仅串行化同键请求；\n入场记录由独立连接提交
repo -> access : enterLocked() 回调
activate access
access -> repo : ② insert(ENTERING, active_plate 唯一)
activate repo
repo --> access : parkingSessionId
deactivate repo
opt ③ 提供预约 ID
  access -> pass : consume(reservationId, sessionId, key)
  activate pass
  pass --> access : 已核销预约及指定车位
  deactivate pass
end
access -> space : ④ available(type)
activate space
space --> access : 候选车位
deactivate space
access -> repo : chooseSpace(sessionId, 候选车位)
access -> space : occupy(spaceId, sessionId, key)
activate space
alt 占位成功
  space --> access : OCCUPIED、位置
  deactivate space
  access -> repo : ⑤ chooseSpace(); parked(sessionId)
  activate repo
  repo --> access : PARKED
  deactivate repo
else 占位失败或结果不确定
  space --> access : 409 / 503 / 超时
  deactivate space
  opt 占位可能已成功
    access -> space : release(spaceId, sessionId, key)
    space --> access : 补偿结果
  end
  opt 预约已核销
    access -> pass : release-consumption(reservationId, sessionId)
    pass --> access : 恢复结果
  end
  access -> repo : entryFailed(sessionId) [补偿均完成]
end
access --> repo : ⑥ SessionView / 业务异常
deactivate access
repo --> access : 释放请求键锁并返回结果
deactivate repo
access --> controller : SessionView / 409 / 503
controller --> 收费员 : 车位位置 / 可理解的失败信息
deactivate access
deactivate controller
note over access,space
  本图是对象级交互；跨服务不是一个数据库事务。
  同键重试读取同一停车记录；补偿未完成时保留 ENTERING 供重试。
end note
@enduml
